WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Begin in Mountain Pose and shift your weight into the left foot.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend the right knee and place the sole of the right foot on the inner left thigh or calf (avoid the knee).

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Press foot and leg into each other and find a steady gaze.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Bring hands to heart or reach the arms overhead like branches.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then switch sides.
